{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21942","headline":"读汉书 · 白居易","name":"读汉书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禾黍与稂莠，雨来同日滋。\n桃李与荆棘，霜降同夜萎。\n草木既区别，荣枯那等夷。\n茫茫天地意，无乃太无私。\n小人与君子，用置各有宜。\n奈何西汉末，忠邪竝信之。\n不然尽信忠，早绝邪臣窥。\n不然尽信邪，早使忠臣知。\n优游两不断，盛业日已衰。\n痛矣萧京辈，终令陷祸机。\n每读元成纪，愤愤令人悲。\n寄言爲国者，不得学天时。\n寄言爲臣者，可以鉴於斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}